# BuildKit reads this instead of the root .dockerignore when building
# docker/Dockerfile.remote. The image copies only src/, config/, alembic/ and
# the root files it names, so everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.env.example
!alembic.ini
!src/
!config/
!alembic/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
